WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:04,500
Which one is more expensive

2
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:06,980
Of course it's the Big Bally semi-automatic.

3
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:08,660
Powerful and long range

4
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:10,300
Can fire eight bullets in a row

5
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:11,900
Although the long range is 700 meters

6
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:13,180
But this is valuable

7
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:15,300
One costs four hundred yuan.

8
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:17,860
I want a Big Bari and a Samurai Jianguo

9
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:19,540
Just buy a Samurai

10
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:22,980
We won't need that big Barry for hunting. Don't waste your money, bro.

11
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:25,720
Hunting always brings danger to me

12
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:26,920
Everyone can take care of each other

13
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:28,320
But fishing at sea

14
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:30,000
At most, two or three people together

15
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:31,600
If you meet pirates

16
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:32,960
The more people on the other side, the more important it is

17
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:34,880
Sometimes they even go out all at once

18
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Three or four boats as prizes

19
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:38,320
If the weapons in the fishermen's hands no longer work,

20
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:41,340
Then the acidity will be completely gone, okay?

21
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:42,820
If you have many children in your family

22
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:43,940
You have to put this gun away

23
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:47,740
It's no joke if the gun goes off while you're wiping it. Don't worry, I'll pay attention.

24
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:49,300
Although two guns cost more than 500, they are not cheap.

25
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:50,820
But in this era, only if you have a gun can you be brave.

26
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:52,100
It's money well spent

27
00:00:52,340 --> 00:00:54,580
This kid can actually take out more than five hundred in one go

28
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:56,140
Doesn't look like the black sheep of the crew.

29
00:00:56,420 --> 00:00:57,420
I want to see him

30
00:00:57,580 --> 00:00:58,580
How can I make money here?

31
00:00:58,780 --> 00:01:07,040
I just made a fortune with these two bullet armors.

32
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,640
These bullets are of the May 4th type.

33
00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:10,080
These are from Grand Bahrain

34
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:11,520
These old men gave them to you

35
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:13,080
If the bullets that turn back are not enough

36
00:01:13,240 --> 00:01:15,520
Come to me to buy at any time. Thank you, sir.

37
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:18,160
Although it is only 1980

38
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:19,960
Domestic gun control is not strict

39
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:22,480
But I can't tell anyone about the gun either.

40
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:23,760
It is better to do less than to do more

41
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:39,770
And this is my secret weapon. It's late when you come back. Jianguo has been on the road all day. Get some rest early. Okay, sister-in-law, what do you think I'm going to do?

42
00:01:39,930 --> 00:01:42,370
How can this guy and my sister live together when we haven't remarried yet?
